# wobbly.beats -- synthetic, written by hand for the warp demo.
#
# Format: <time-in-seconds> <beat-in-bar>   (beat-in-bar 1 = downbeat, 4/4)
#
# Tempo deliberately WANDERS so warping has something to do:
#   beats  1-5   spaced 0.600 s  -> 100 BPM
#   beats  5-9   spaced 0.500 s  -> 120 BPM
#   beats  9-13  spaced 0.400 s  -> 150 BPM
#   beats 13-16  spaced 0.500 s  -> 120 BPM
# Against a 120 BPM project grid the segment rates are 1.2, 1.0, 0.8, 1.0.
# First beat at 0.250 s (a short lead-in, no pickup -- it starts on a downbeat).
0.250	1
0.850	2
1.450	3
2.050	4
2.650	1
3.150	2
3.650	3
4.150	4
4.650	1
5.050	2
5.450	3
5.850	4
6.250	1
6.750	2
7.250	3
7.750	4
